<title>UK: Benetton sets 500 billion lire five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Benetton sets 500 billion lire five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers IMI Bank Lux, J.P. Morgan Securities and Banca Nazionale del Lavoro.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BENETTON GROUP SPA</p>
<p> AMT    500 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    18.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +12.5 BP  PAY DATE    18.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   ISS PRICE  100.175   FULL FEES   0.35</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/GB/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.175     SELL CONC  0.175     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
